The Total Score consists of <span color="#9D7615">[Position Score]</> and <span color="#9D7615">[General Score]</>.
<span color="#9D7615">[Position Score]</> is determined by three dimensions: Offense, Confrontation, and Support, with scores calculated based on the player's role.
• Offense: Damage share, number of perfect dodges;
• Confrontation: Red Glowing counters, threat duration, damage share;
• Support: Ally healing, team buffs, damage share;
<span color="#9D7615">[General Score]</> is determined by general dimensions, with calculation rules shared by all players.
• General: Damage share, number of monster double stuns, number of rescues;
The displayed score is rounded to one decimal place and does not affect the final MVP assessment.

The Sword Sect has retreated from the world, and the decaying sword is sealed away. None should approach the Cave of No Light.
The Workshop Master has bestowed three keys to the chaotic clouds. <69D0FF> Obtain these three keys to open the stone gate </>—
First, quench with water;
Second, hide the edge in the mold;
Third, cover the face with emotion.

Inside the Shadowless Cave, the <69D0FF> Sword Sect </> has lived in seclusion for a century.
Unless the Master of the Workshop visits in person, do not disturb the Sword Sect's meditation.
Furthermore, the forging secrets taught by the Master require the complete set of keys to open the stone door.
First, quench with water;
Second, hide the edge in the blank;
Third, cover the face with emotion.
